## What's new

- Uses the same outlined PillMenu styling as Output’s Stereo (Out 1–2) control.
- Matches the lower blank label-slot height and hover/native menu behavior.
- Preserves the verified stereo source assignment routing and existing DAW/Direct Monitor behavior.
- Sparkle scheduled update checks remain optional; you can disable them in **Device Settings › Preferences** while **Check for Updates…** remains available.

[Read the full release notes on GitHub](https://github.com/danielraffel/unofficial-symphony-maestro-mk1/releases/tag/v0.8.13)
